category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Asynchronous DNS query library written in C++ (runtime)"
ldesc: "AsyncResolv is an asynchronous DNS query library written in C++.Resolver is
capable of most rfc1035 resource records parsing, supports queries over UDP
and over TCP (if UDP failed)"
external-source: asyncresolv

